message: "If you use Zoth Studio in your research on sovereign AI, multi-agent systems, biomorphic cognitive memory, or local-first developer computing, please cite it as below."
title: "Zoth Studio: Local-First Multi-Agent Browser Cockpit, Biomorphic STDP Vector Memory & Autonomous Web Foundry"
