abstract: "Zoth Studio is a sovereign, local-first computing platform and multi-agent browser cockpit built on zero-cloud egress and strict 127.0.0.1 loopback isolation. It integrates a 21-agent autonomous Pantheon, dual-layer associative vector memory governed by Spike-Timing-Dependent Plasticity (STDP) and Continuous Modern Hopfield Networks, multi-model consensus via Shannon Agreement Entropy minimization, an Argon2id/XChaCha20-Poly1305 hardware-isolated key vault, and an interactive 12-formula #つぶやきProcessing 3D spatial topology laboratory."
